still I somewhat agree because, you like to think that it's gonna be something else, it's gonna be a cyst, it's gonna be benign,

00:00:44.940 --> 00:00:49.780
but then when they actually tell you and you hear those words "You have breast cancer", it's like...

00:00:50.380 --> 00:00:53.760
For me I had a childhood cancer, so I was diagnosed when I was eight.

00:00:53.760 --> 00:00:57.030
And you know -I'm a kid- I don't think about this kind of stuff.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:01:03.180
I'm thinking about you know, playing tag with my friends or going to the movies. It was definitely a shock.

