feel the same way. Back pain and leg pain, only symptoms and we just go to work being miserable,

00:01:10.479 --> 00:01:12.749
go home, and lie in bed, and my parents are like: "You know,

00:01:13.450 --> 00:01:14.979
maybe you should go to the ER"

00:01:14.979 --> 00:01:20.609
And then we get there and they do a scan like oh you have a giant mass in you. I'm like, okay great!

